{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925420/extras/9a56e1914e1d57d3b477f5ade21b422d.poster.avif?t=1754877362\" width=600 height=144 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925420/extras/9a56e1914e1d57d3b477f5ade21b422d.webm?t=1754877362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925420/extras/9a56e1914e1d57d3b477f5ade21b422d.mp4?t=1754877362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fleshinsane</strong> is a top-down biopunk roguelike shooter set in a decaying living spaceship. Play as cursed survivors with unique abilities, doomed to die and rise again. The deeper you go, the faster the ship rots \u2014 environments shift, flesh mutates, and chaos accelerates. Harvest agony from fallen enemies to evolve new powers and twisted forms. Fight through grotesque halls and uncover the secrets of flesh and steel. Can you escape the endless decay?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2925420?t=1754877362","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754877362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925420/f572c7cbee2000625fbad98a6413c11d88abc3c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754877362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925420/f572c7cbee2000625fbad98a6413c11d88abc3c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754877362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Shar